{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"I have more power than anyone else here at the moment. I have the power to ensure that this one dies and you die with them, or at the very least suffer in insignificance for a very long time.\" He says, looking coldly at the queen as his eyes darken a shade.","created_at":"2021-08-26T08:10:02.872000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880363450126172220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"What do you know of death? I could scrub my eyes with all of the power you could muster and not go blind. No. You do not hold more power than a Queen who has rulled empires. I will not ever die. You only slow my progress by little more than a week. So kill it. Or eat your threats with your ineffectual rage.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T08:13:43.834000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-26T08:13:54.619000Z","id":"880364376907997185","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
